      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-28T18:48:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is one of the funniest episodes in recent memory. :D All the new meta lore about the Rainbow Roadie, and especially that series of conversations between Soothsayer Carmichael and Argent Adept. I love watching them make a character and then instantly bring it to life. The banter in this episode was 500% on point!</p>\n<p>Also, glad to hear Celestia and Luna are canon to Sentinel Comics. XD Looks like I have my new MLP crossover fanfic idea since the old one got canon-screwed!</p>\n<p>And I finally have a question to ask with my dumb bit...</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:08:58.043Z",
